---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ToolsShell from "../../layouts/ToolsShell.astro";
// فحص qSOFA السريع للإنتان — qSOFA Sepsis Screen
---

<Layout title="فحص qSOFA السريع للإنتان">
  <ToolsShell>
    <section class="tools-scope tool-page">
  <header class="tool-hero">
    <h1>
      <span data-ar>فحص qSOFA السريع للإنتان</span>
      <span data-en dir="ltr">qSOFA Sepsis Screen</span>
    </h1>
    <span class="badge badge-new">NEW</span>
    <p class="credit-line">Sepsis-3 Definitions, 2016</p>
  </header>

  <article class="info-block">
    <h2><span data-ar>ما هي؟</span><span data-en dir="ltr">What is it?</span></h2>
    <p>
      <span data-ar>فحص سريع من 3 معايير سريرية فقط (بدون تحاليل مخبرية) يُستخدم عند الشك بوجود عدوى، لتقدير خطر تدهور المريض ودخوله في إنتان شديد خارج وحدة العناية المركزة.</span>
      <span data-en dir="ltr">A rapid 3-criterion bedside screen (no labs needed) used when infection is suspected, to flag risk of deterioration into severe sepsis outside the ICU.</span>
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="info-block">
    <h2><span data-ar>لماذا يهم؟</span><span data-en dir="ltr">Why it matters</span></h2>
    <p>
      <span data-ar>يمكن إجراؤه فورًا عند سرير المريض في قسم الطوارئ أو الجناح العام دون انتظار نتائج التحاليل، ونتيجة إيجابية تستدعي تقييمًا أعمق وربما نقلًا لمستوى رعاية أعلى.</span>
      <span data-en dir="ltr">Can be done immediately at the bedside in the ER or general ward without waiting for lab results; a positive result warrants deeper evaluation and possibly escalation of care.</span>
    </p>
  </article>

  <form class="calc-form" id="qsofa-form">
    <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" id="rr" /> <span data-ar>معدل التنفس ≥ 22/دقيقة</span><span data-en dir="ltr">Respiratory rate ≥22/min</span></label>
    <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" id="mentation" /> <span data-ar>اضطراب الوعي (مقياس غلاسكو &lt; 15)</span><span data-en dir="ltr">Altered mentation (GCS &lt;15)</span></label>
    <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" id="sbp" /> <span data-ar>الضغط الانقباضي ≤ 100 mmHg</span><span data-en dir="ltr">Systolic BP ≤100 mmHg</span></label>
    <button type="submit">
      <span data-ar>احسب</span>
      <span data-en dir="ltr">Calculate</span>
    </button>
  </form>

  <div class="result-box" id="result" hidden>
    <p class="result-line">
      <span data-ar>المجموع: </span><span data-en dir="ltr">Score: </span>
      <strong id="score-out"></strong> / 3
    </p>
    <p class="result-line">
      <span data-ar>التفسير: </span><span data-en dir="ltr">Interpretation: </span>
      <strong id="interp-out"></strong>
    </p>
  </div>

  <article class="info-block">
    <h2><span data-ar>القياس الطبيعي / التفسير</span><span data-en dir="ltr">Reference interpretation</span></h2>
    <ul class="ref-list">
      <li><span data-ar>0 – 1: خطر منخفض نسبيًا لتدهور المريض داخل المستشفى</span><span data-en dir="ltr">0–1: lower risk of in-hospital deterioration</span></li>
      <li><span data-ar>2 – 3: خطر أعلى بكثير — يستدعي تقييمًا عاجلًا لوظائف الأعضاء وربما نقلًا للعناية المركزة</span><span data-en dir="ltr">2–3: substantially higher risk — warrants urgent organ-function assessment and possible ICU escalation</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="note">
      <span data-ar>qSOFA أداة فرز سريعة وليست أداة تشخيص للإنتان بحد ذاتها.</span>
      <span data-en dir="ltr">qSOFA is a rapid screening tool, not a standalone diagnosis of sepsis.</span>
    </p>
  </article>

  <a class="back-link" href="/meters/">
    <span data-ar>← رجوع لمجال المؤشرات التقييمية</span>
    <span data-en dir="ltr">← Back to Assessment &amp; Risk Indices</span>
  </a>
    </section>
  </ToolsShell>
</Layout>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById("qsofa-form") as HTMLFormElement;
  form?.addEventListener("submit", (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const ids = ["rr", "mentation", "sbp"];
    const total = ids.reduce((sum, id) => sum + ((document.getElementById(id) as HTMLInputElement).checked ? 1 : 0), 0);

    let interpAr = "", interpEn = "";
    if (total >= 2) { interpAr = "خطر مرتفع"; interpEn = "High risk"; }
    else { interpAr = "خطر أقل نسبيًا"; interpEn = "Lower risk"; }

    (document.getElementById("score-out") as HTMLElement).textContent = String(total);
    (document.getElementById("interp-out") as HTMLElement).textContent = `${interpAr} / ${interpEn}`;
    (document.getElementById("result") as HTMLElement).hidden = false;
  });
</script>

<style>
  .tool-page { padding-block: 2rem; max-width: 42rem; margin-inline: auto; }
  .tool-hero { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
  .tool-hero h1 { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .15rem; }
  .tool-hero [data-en] { font-size: .65em; opacity: .6; font-weight: 500; }
  .badge-new { font-size: .7rem; padding: .2rem .6rem; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(30,110,200,.14); font-weight: 700; }
  .credit-line { font-size: .75rem; opacity: .5; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; width: 100%; }
  .info-block { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .info-block h2 { display: flex; gap: .5rem; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
  .info-block h2 [data-en] { opacity: .6; font-weight: 500; }
  .info-block [data-en] { display: block; font-size: .9em; opacity: .7; margin-top: .3rem; }
  .ref-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .4rem; }
  .ref-list li { padding: .5rem .75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,.04); border-radius: .4rem; }
  .ref-list [data-en] { display: block; font-size: .85em; opacity: .65; }
  .note { font-size: .85rem; opacity: .75; margin-top: .75rem; }
  .note [data-en] { display: block; margin-top: .2rem; }

  .calc-form { display: grid; gap: .75rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12); border-radius: .75rem; }
  .checkbox-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; font-size: .9rem; }
  .checkbox-label [data-en] { opacity: .6; font-size: .85em; }
  .calc-form button { justify-self: start; padding: .6rem 1.5rem; border: none; border-radius: .5rem; background: #1d6f5c; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; margin-top: .5rem; }
  .calc-form button [data-en] { display: block; font-size: .75em; opacity: .85; }

  .result-box { padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: .75rem; background: rgba(29,111,92,.08); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .result-line { margin: .3rem 0; }
  .result-line [data-en] { opacity: .7; }

  .back-link { display: inline-block; font-size: .85rem; text-decoration: none; }
</style>
